    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devious Androliens have trapped the beloved superhero Beetle Roller inside a digital world, and it's up to you to help him escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race to the goal</strong> of each stage while <strong>posing fabulously!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.poster.avif?t=1747969870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.webm?t=1747969870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect\u00a0colorful orbs</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0grow your\u00a0Beetle\u00a0Ball gadget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.poster.avif?t=1747969870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.webm?t=1747969870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And use your ball's power to <strong>squash your foes!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.poster.avif?t=1747969870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.webm?t=1747969870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BREAKDOWN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay inspired by a mashup of <i>Katamari</i>, <i>Monkey Ball</i>,<i> </i>and <i>Pizza Tower</i> with a <i>Kamen Rider</i> inspired protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant and explosive art style inspired by anime and PS2 era games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 blood-pumping levels with 3 different aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 time ranks to collect in each level - can you get the fastest time? Prepare yourself for BEETLE ROLLER'S FINAL JUDGEMENT...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO! GO! Beetle Roller! was developed as a four-person student project at Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within a ~10 week period.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The devious Androliens have trapped the beloved superhero Beetle Roller inside a digital world, and it's up to you to help him escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Race to the goal</strong> of each stage while <strong>posing fabulously!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.poster.avif?t=1747969870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/8d012f04e19a049441ea5af7d089b2aa.webm?t=1747969870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect\u00a0colorful orbs</strong>\u00a0to\u00a0grow your\u00a0Beetle\u00a0Ball gadget! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.poster.avif?t=1747969870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/3920ed28e9c65aca2016105a3de209ed.webm?t=1747969870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And use your ball's power to <strong>squash your foes!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.poster.avif?t=1747969870\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3699950/extras/35c82beb09164c27577dd1e28ab48c5d.webm?t=1747969870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE BREAKDOWN</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay inspired by a mashup of <i>Katamari</i>, <i>Monkey Ball</i>,<i> </i>and <i>Pizza Tower</i> with a <i>Kamen Rider</i> inspired protagonist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant and explosive art style inspired by anime and PS2 era games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 blood-pumping levels with 3 different aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 time ranks to collect in each level - can you get the fastest time? Prepare yourself for BEETLE ROLLER'S FINAL JUDGEMENT...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OUR STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO! GO! Beetle Roller! was developed as a four-person student project at Eastern Michigan University. The game was created from scratch within a ~10 week period.</p>",
